:: Use Potion
<<if $has_healing_potion and $hp < $max_hp>>
<<set $hp += 25>>
<<if $hp > $max_hp>><<set $hp to $max_hp>><</if>>
<<set $has_healing_potion to false>>
<<set $inventory = $inventory.filter(function(item) { return item !== "Healing Potion" })>>

You drink the healing potion. A warm glow spreads through your body, mending your wounds.

''HP restored by 25. Current HP: $hp / $max_hp.''

[[Back|Inventory View]]
<<elseif $has_healing_potion>>
You're already at full health. No need to waste a potion.
[[Back|Inventory View]]
<<else>>
You don't have a healing potion.
[[Back|Inventory View]]
<</if>>
